<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.9500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.9500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.9500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.8900 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Feb 7		   Feb 6</p>
<p> High			     75.8700		 75.7800</p>
<p> Low				75.9500		 75.8900</p>
<p> Open			     75.9500		 75.8200</p>
<p> Close			    75.9500		 75.8900</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  6.695		   2.390</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
